<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.1//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml11/DTD/xhtml11.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="ko"><head><title>[WindowContainer] 윈도우를 닫았을 때 남아 있는 윈도우를 자동 정렬 하기</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="css/book.css" type="text/css" /><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="application/xhtml+xml; charset=utf-8" /><meta name="EPB-UUID" content="f1fbcef72ff0a2ec" /></head><body><div class="chapter_content"><h1 id="r_0a30b8d15fbae5da" class="chapter_title">[WindowContainer] 윈도우를 닫았을 때 남아 있는 윈도우를 자동 정렬 하기</h1><h1 id="r_67d72abdc0525676" class="element heading1" data-element-id="67d72abdc0525676"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">1</span><span>개요</span></div></h1><pre id="r_d4702672daf38a2d" class="element pre" data-element-id="d4702672daf38a2d">WindowContainer의 'autoArrange' 속성을 사용하여, 윈도우를 닫으면 남은 윈도우가 자동 정렬되도록 설정한 예제입니다.</pre><p id="r_330ab71f11e4ebb8" class="element r_example_link_p" data-element-id="330ab71f11e4ebb8"><a class="link" href="http://example.websquare.kr/link.html?p=P00146">P00146</a></p><h1 id="r_6e94f75195100e35" class="element heading1" data-element-id="6e94f75195100e35"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">2</span><span>구현된 기능</span></div></h1><ul id="r_f5e629ad9f207a6d" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="f5e629ad9f207a6d"><li><p>윈도우 자동 정렬 기능 설정</p></li><li><p>(기본) 윈도우 자동 정렬 기능 미설정</p></li></ul><h1 id="r_891a47b646de75c8" class="element heading1" data-element-id="891a47b646de75c8"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">3</span><span>예제 테스트 방법</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_848a525c30a21c8f" class="element heading2" data-element-id="848a525c30a21c8f"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.1</span><span>윈도우 자동 정렬 기능 설정</span></div></h2><pre id="r_d0c86da87c84aa2f" class="element pre" data-element-id="d0c86da87c84aa2f">예제 영역 '<span class="r_th_title_1_span">윈도우 자동 정렬 기능 설정</span>'에서 테스트합니다.</pre><div id="r_e934882dbfb4431f" class="element step1" data-element-id="e934882dbfb4431f"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>STEP 1: WindowContainer의 첫번째 윈도우를 닫습니다.</p></div><div id="r_f959f3590a55548b" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="f959f3590a55548b"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 1.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image1615.png" width="339" height="346" /></p></div><div id="r_fb2fbe6f3dea4761" class="element step1" data-element-id="fb2fbe6f3dea4761"><p class="step1_n">2</p><p>STEP 2: 실행 결과를 확인합니다.</p></div><p id="r_4fe4ca3ad998abc0" class="element normal step1_indent" data-element-id="4fe4ca3ad998abc0">남은 윈도우가 재 정렬됩니다.</p><div id="r_de7ac916e808640b" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="de7ac916e808640b"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 2.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image1616.png" width="343" height="348" /></p></div><h2 id="r_f805a0e96625312f" class="element heading2" data-element-id="f805a0e96625312f"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.2</span><span>(기본) 윈도우 자동 정렬 기능 미설정</span></div></h2><pre id="r_9ba905e5507aadef" class="element pre" data-element-id="9ba905e5507aadef">예제 영역 '<span class="r_th_title_1_span">(기본 설정) 윈도우 자동 정렬 기능 미설정</span>'에서 테스트합니다.</pre><div id="r_29e52bea222d598f" class="element step1" data-element-id="29e52bea222d598f"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>STEP 1: WindowContainer의 첫번째 윈도우를 닫습니다.</p></div><div id="r_821c8752c0dbeb0d" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="821c8752c0dbeb0d"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 3.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image1615.png" width="339" height="346" /></p></div><div id="r_338b392c46851f91" class="element step1" data-element-id="338b392c46851f91"><p class="step1_n">2</p><p>STEP 2: 실행 결과를 확인합니다.</p></div><p id="r_4dbee036c5bfa50e" class="element normal step1_indent" data-element-id="4dbee036c5bfa50e">남은 윈도우의 위치가 동일하게 유지됩니다.</p><div id="r_9043b2da1b7ce771" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="9043b2da1b7ce771"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 4.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image1617.png" width="340" height="344" /></p></div><h1 id="r_2e4168a19ead9eba" class="element heading1" data-element-id="2e4168a19ead9eba"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">4</span><span>구현 예시</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_0fb0b78b722dfb7b" class="element heading2" data-element-id="0fb0b78b722dfb7b"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">4.1</span><span>윈도우 자동 정렬 기능 설정하기</span></div></h2><div id="r_ea9b28869f56fadd" class="element step1" data-element-id="ea9b28869f56fadd"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>WindowContainer의 속성을 정의합니다.</p></div><ul id="r_2c3d2d91474c8987" class="element unordered_list step1_indent" data-element-id="2c3d2d91474c8987"><li><p><span class="r_blue001_span">[필수] autoArrange="true"</span> </p><p>윈도우 재정렬 지정</p></li></ul><div id="r_5f5cc080f29ae547" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="5f5cc080f29ae547"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 5.</span>웹스퀘어 스튜디오의 Component View 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image1618.png" width="377" height="134" /></p></div><div id="r_1364c783faf33193" class="element code support_code_numbering step1_indent" data-element-id="1364c783faf33193"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 1.</span>Source</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">&lt;!-- windowContainer 의 소스 본문 예시 --&gt;</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&lt;w2:windowContainer <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">autoArrange</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"true"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">id</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"wdc_exam2"</span>&gt;
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_comment_span">&lt;!-- 중략 --&gt;</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&lt;/w2:windowContainer&gt;</pre></div><h1 id="r_f7e5ce9cd0a32f36" class="element heading1" data-element-id="f7e5ce9cd0a32f36"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">5</span><span>주요 API</span></div></h1><ul id="r_74d0227c4f057ca5" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="74d0227c4f057ca5"><li><p><span class="r_ex_api_property_span">autoArrange</span></p></li></ul></div></body></html>